# Vantage Admin Project Organization

`vantage-admin` is the Next.js 16 App Router owner/admin dashboard. Preserve ownership boundaries; put new work in the folder that owns the behavior.

## Architecture Map

| Area | Owns |
|------|------|
| `app/(auth)/` | Owner login (`/login`) |
| `app/(dashboard)/` | Protected dashboard pages + layouts |
| `app/(public)/` | Public surfaces (`/employee-booking`) |
| `app/api/auth/` | Local admin session handlers only |
| `app/api/audit-log/` | Local audit reads from admin Mongo (never proxy) |
| `app/api/proxy/[...path]/` | Authenticated BFF → `vantage-main-server` |
| `app/api/employee-booking/` | Public options/submit (feature-flagged; not dashboard auth) |
| `proxy.ts` | Next 16 request-boundary auth (not `middleware.ts`) |
| `components/ui/` | shadcn-compatible primitives |
| `components/layout/` | Shell, nav, login, global search, scope controls, role context |
| `components/filters/`, `data-table/`, `record-detail/` | Shared table/detail primitives |
| `components/operational/` | Shared operational list/detail/edit (`operational-resource-page.tsx`) |
| `components/forms/` | Booking + cancellation create workflows |
| `components/dashboard/` | Home overview |
| `components/analytics/`, `reports/` | Analytics + agent-sales report UI |
| `components/observational/` | Observability tabs (events/incidents/reports/notifications/sheet-sync) |
| `components/operations-registry/` | Registry shell: agents, merchants, sources, Granot sources, CPL, RingCentral, changes |
| `components/ingestion/` | Best Relocation + Granot automation dashboards |
| `components/granot-lifecycle/` | Read-only Granot lifecycle case, candidate, and timeline UI |
| `components/reporting/` | Report definitions, destinations, runs, Google settings |
| `components/reconciliation/` | Booking-lead reconciliation dashboard |
| `components/employee-booking/` | Public employee booking form |
| `components/settings/` | Settings tabs (carriers + legacy CPL); prefer registry for catalog/sources/CPL |
| `lib/api/` | Browser clients + filter/URL/CSV helpers (see clients below) |
| `lib/query/` | TanStack Query provider + `queryKeys` |
| `lib/reporting/`, `lib/google/`, `lib/reconciliation/` | Pure/client helpers for those surfaces |
| `lib/env/`, `lib/db/`, `lib/constants/` | Server env, admin Mongo, domain constants |
| `server/auth/` | Sessions, JWT, `routeGuard`, role ACL, proxy signing, trusted headers |
| `server/audit/` | Admin audit writes + proxy audit payloads |
| `server/models/` | `AdminUser`, `AdminAuditLog` |
| `server/vantage-api/` | Server-only API client (`x-api-secret`), URL/response/errors |
